  "description": "This is our 27.5\" (650B) geared bike. After years of middling about in no-man’s land, the 27.5 deal has taken off big time. More fork and tire options has made this wheel size a less scary proposition. When we rode the first Option B we built back in 2008 we knew it could be a \"thing\", and now it is. If you like a little more flickability than a 29r allows and wouldn’t be caught dead on a 26” bike, this is your ride.\n\n- 2 Coat Powder Paint With Iron Phosphate Pre-Treatment\n- Complete Custom Fitting\n- Externally Butted Head Tube\n- Frame Delivered Fully Prepped And Ready To Assemble With Rust Inhibitor Sprayed Inside Seat Tube And On All Bare Metal Surfaces\n- Gusseted Head Tube/Downtube Junction (where applicable)\n- Internally Butted Head Tube\n- Reinforced Seat Collar Insert\n- Rider Specific Tubeset\n- Sealed Tubeset (no vent holes)\n- Sloping Top Tube Standard\n- Stainless Steel Cable Stops And Brake Line Guides\n- Stamped head badge\n- Tig Welded Frame",
